                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excerpt From the Issue of November</hi> 29<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">th</hi>, 1930, <hi rendition="#small-caps">of the
                        Italian Radical Paper “II Martello” Published in New York</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush">Article entitled “Civilta’ Fascista” on the first page (last
                    paragraph)</p>
                <p>“Lo abbiamo detto tante volte, e lo ripetiamo: uceidefe il fascismo nelle persone
                    dei suoi responsabili e’ Opera Santa. Per PItalia, per il monde intero”.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Translation</hi></p>
                <p>“We have said it so many times and we repeat it: to kill fascism in the persons
                    of those responsible for it is a Holy Work. For Italy, for the whole world”.</p>
            </div>
